    "summary": "Soviet-derived mechanised army modernising with a multi-vector mix: Russian (BTR-82A, Mi-35M, Tigr), Turkish (Cobra, Anka) and South African-licensed (Arlan) equipment, plus Israeli drones. CSTO member that stayed neutral on the Ukraine war. Contributes UN peacekeepers (UNDOF Golan, UNIFIL with the Indian battalion). Focus on border security toward Central Asia and counter-terrorism.",
