  "notes": "Neutral, multi-vector CSTO member. Kazakh peacekeepers serve on the Golan (UNDOF, since 2024) and with the Indian battalion in UNIFIL, which places them in levant_syria and lebanon_south maps as neutral blue-helmet units the player must not harm. Barys 8x8 (Mbombe-based) exists in small numbers. In game: an occasional client and a cheap source of Soviet-pattern gear; contracts for Kazakhstan do not lock out Western work but may annoy Russia.",
